Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 05:19:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Redesign portfolio and move all content into src/data.js

- Extract all site content (profile, experience, projects, skills,
  education) into src/data.js so updates never touch component code;
  includes a ready-to-fill template for the IBM internship entry
- Refine the visual design: experience timeline instead of accordion,
  grouped skill tags instead of percentage bars, single copper accent,
  remove terminal widget / stat boxes / glow blobs / decorative glyphs
- Fix broken body font (Satoshi isn't on Google Fonts) by switching
  to Inter; keep DM Serif Display for headings
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion; improve page title and meta
- Rewrite README with a step-by-step content update guide

